1
00:00:00,344 --> 00:00:03,014
(line ringing)

2
00:00:03,015 --> 00:00:04,145
(Sheldon:)Hello.

3
00:00:04,149 --> 00:00:05,349
SHELDON:
Hello.

4
00:00:05,350 --> 00:00:07,880
(Sheldon:)Listen, I've been
thinking a lot

5
00:00:07,886 --> 00:00:09,286
(Sheldon:)about relationships

6
00:00:09,288 --> 00:00:12,558
(Sheldon:)and how difficult they can be,
and I think...

7
00:00:12,558 --> 00:00:14,588
(Sheldon:)I've been thinking
about them, too, Sheldon.

8
00:00:16,294 --> 00:00:19,294
(Amy:)Being your girlfriend
is so challenging.

9
00:00:19,298 --> 00:00:20,698
(Amy:)Emotionally,

10
00:00:20,699 --> 00:00:22,869
(Amy:)physically.

11
00:00:22,868 --> 00:00:26,208
(Amy:)I've been incredibly patient
for years.

12
00:00:27,171 --> 00:00:28,871
(Sheldon:)Strongly disagree.

13
00:00:28,874 --> 00:00:30,644
(Sheldon:)Go on.

14
00:00:30,642 --> 00:00:34,042
(Leonard:)Okay, well...

15
00:00:34,046 --> 00:00:38,086
(Amy:)this isn't easy to say,
because I love you,

16
00:00:38,083 --> 00:00:39,853
(Sheldon:)but...

17
00:00:39,852 --> 00:00:43,592
(Amy:)I need some time
to take a step back

18
00:00:43,589 --> 00:00:46,589
(Amy:)and reevaluate our situation.

19
00:00:48,259 --> 00:00:49,859
(Amy:)Oh.

20
00:00:49,862 --> 00:00:52,962
(Amy:)I hope you understand.

21
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:57,130
(Penny:)Okay.

22
00:00:58,503 --> 00:01:00,573
(Amy:)Bye, Sheldon.

23
00:01:18,923 --> 00:01:20,993
(Sheldon:)Well, Gollum...

24
00:01:22,927 --> 00:01:26,267
(Sheldon:)...you're an expert on rings.

25
00:01:26,265 --> 00:01:29,335
(Sheldon:)What do I do with this one?

